0..56 Comment "//! This source shows the phase distinction in a module."
57..60 Comment "//!"
61..119 Comment "//! Type members are static and value members are dynamic."
120..196 Comment "//! A member can read only members at its phase or below it. So a type reads"
197..243 Comment "//! types and static data. A value reads both."
244..247 Comment "//!"
248..327 Comment "//! A type member that reads the value of a module or a parameter is refused by"
328..372 Comment "//! name at the value, as `PhaseDependence`."
373..438 Comment "//! The lowering keeps static and dynamic members in phase order."
439..442 Comment "//!"
443..486 Comment "//! - see: pathological/modules/phase.gandr"
487..583 Comment "//! - cites: [Sterling-2021-logical_relations_types_proofrelevant_parametricity_program_modules]"
584..587 Comment "//!"
588..808 Comment "//! [Sterling-2021-logical_relations_types_proofrelevant_parametricity_program_modules]: https://doi.org/10.1145/3474834 \"Sterling and Harper, Logical relations as types: proof-relevant parametricity for program modules\""
